course: dictionary
lesson: 4602
title: Herpes and the clues around it
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words come from health and science, and context helps you understand them. «Cold sores are caused by a herpes simplex virus that stays in the body and can come back when you're ill or in the sun.» The words caused by a virus tell you that herpes is an illness that starts with a tiny germ.
explain: Look at the other clues in the sentence. A virus stays in the body, and it can come back. So herpes is an infection, and one kind of it gives cold sores, which are small, painful blisters around the mouth.
explain: The clues also tell you what to do. Cold sores spread by touching or kissing, so do not share cups or lip balm with someone who has one. Herpes is not a sign of being dirty, and a doctor or pharmacist can give cream to help.
fact: Herpes is a common infection caused by a virus.
fact: Cold sores are small, painful blisters around the mouth, and one kind of herpes causes them.
fact: Some herpes viruses also cause chickenpox and shingles.
fact: Cold sores spread by touching or kissing, so do not share cups or lip balm with someone who has one.
fact: Herpes is not a sign of being dirty, and a doctor or pharmacist can give cream to help.
exercise: «Cold sores are caused by a herpes simplex virus.» What causes cold sores? | Sitting too close to the telly | *A herpes simplex virus | A cold wind | Eating too many sweets
exercise: What is a cold sore? | A kind of cold drink | A sore throat from shouting | *A small painful blister around the mouth | A large bruise on the leg
exercise: Which illness is also caused by a herpes virus? | Earache | Hay fever | *Chickenpox | A broken arm
test: Why should you not share lip balm when someone has a cold sore? | Because it makes your lips too shiny | *Because cold sores spread by touching or kissing | Because lip balm is too cold | Because it tastes bad
test: Is herpes a sign of being dirty? | Yes, always | Only if you eat with your hands | *No, herpes is common and is not a sign of being dirty | Only in winter
exam: «...can come back when you're ill or in the sun.» What does come back suggest about herpes? | *It can return later | It moves to your leg | It turns into a cold drink | It goes away for ever after one day
